{"id":"n76875-1-9","stage":5,"title":"지장 · 妨碍","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76875-1-9-1","ko":"이가 아픈데 왜 그동안 치과에 가지 않았니?","zh":"牙齿疼，为什么之前都不去牙医那里看看呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이가","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아픈데","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치과에","meaning":"牙科","explanation":"치과：牙科；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"치과","audio":"/audio/09bd449f9d983a5f7f9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72153","senseId":"1","lemma":"치과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"牙齿","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"69529","definition":"长在人或动物嘴里，用于咬东西或咀嚼食物的器官。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"09bd449f9d983a5f","term":"치과","zh":"牙科","audio":"/audio/09bd449f9d983a5f7f9e.mp3","entryId":"72153","definition":"治疗牙齿、牙周组织、口腔等相关疾病的医学领域；或指该领域的医院。","pronunciation":["치꽈"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/def475e0c65b5b74075d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76875-1-9-2","ko":"음식을 먹는 데 별 지장이 없었거든요.","zh":"因为吃饭的时候并没有什么特别的困扰。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식을","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데","meaning":"情况，状况。","explanation":"데：情况，状况。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"3","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별","meaning":"特别的","explanation":"별：特别的","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83164","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지장이","meaning":"妨碍","explanation":"지장：妨碍；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지장","audio":"/audio/259e553a753b8d3e6c7a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76875","senseId":"1","lemma":"지장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없었거든요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"情况，状况。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"情况，状况。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"特别的","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"83164","definition":"不同一般的，特殊或奇怪的。","pronunciation":["별"]},{"id":"259e553a753b8d3e","term":"지장","zh":"妨碍","audio":"/audio/259e553a753b8d3e6c7a.mp3","entryId":"76875","definition":"对事情产生坏影响或造成阻碍的因素。","pronunciation":["지장"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a10da178dfea1e6f1d0d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.309,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76875","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLev